1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:03,816
Scanned PDFs tasveerein hain, text nahi.

2
00:00:03,816 --> 00:00:07,245
Do engine manuals, 1,623 pages, aur ek bhi

3
00:00:07,245 --> 00:00:09,123
searchable akshar nahi.

4
00:00:09,123 --> 00:00:12,961
Ek safety rule dhoondhne mein raat ho jati thi.

5
00:00:12,961 --> 00:00:16,390
PDF Q and A yahi problem khatam karta hai.

6
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:19,442
Ye hai PDF Q and A.

7
00:00:19,442 --> 00:00:22,227
Koi bhi PDF daalo, chahe 1,000 page ka

8
00:00:22,227 --> 00:00:25,305
scanned manual ho, wo har page padhta hai,

9
00:00:25,305 --> 00:00:28,382
sab kuch database mein save karta hai, aur

10
00:00:28,382 --> 00:00:31,460
jawab deta hai exact page number ke saath.

11
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:33,365
No cloud, no subscription.

12
00:00:33,365 --> 00:00:35,930
Tumhare apne machine pe chalta hai.

13
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:40,378
Upload karna hai drag and drop, ek saath

14
00:00:40,378 --> 00:00:41,297
20 files tak.

15
00:00:41,297 --> 00:00:44,408
Scanned pages Rapid OCR khud padhta hai, aur

16
00:00:44,408 --> 00:00:47,519
tum dekhte raho har page database mein jaata

17
00:00:47,519 --> 00:00:47,802
hai:

18
00:00:47,802 --> 00:00:50,418
page number, percent, time remaining.

19
00:00:50,418 --> 00:00:53,670
Kuch bhi tumhare computer se bahar nahi jaata.

20
00:00:55,550 --> 00:00:56,291
Ab poocho.

21
00:00:56,291 --> 00:00:58,957
Jawab aata hai apne source ke saath:

22
00:00:58,957 --> 00:01:02,143
file ka naam, page number, aur match score.

23
00:01:02,143 --> 00:01:05,031
Sources kholo aur tum dekh rahe ho wohi

24
00:01:05,031 --> 00:01:07,402
passage jo database ne dhoondha.

25
00:01:07,402 --> 00:01:09,550
Sab khud verify kar sakte ho.

26
00:01:11,050 --> 00:01:12,373
Ye raha pipeline.

27
00:01:12,373 --> 00:01:15,563
Browser baat karta hai Express server se.

28
00:01:15,563 --> 00:01:18,832
Python worker text nikalta hai PyMuPDF se;

29
00:01:18,832 --> 00:01:21,944
scanned pages jaati hain Rapid OCR mein.

30
00:01:21,944 --> 00:01:25,290
Prisma har page aur chunk likhta hai SQLite

31
00:01:25,290 --> 00:01:28,092
mein, FTS5 full-text index ke saath.

32
00:01:28,092 --> 00:01:31,827
Sawaal pehle BM25 search chalata hai, phir jawab

33
00:01:31,827 --> 00:01:33,850
banta hai top passages se.

34
00:01:35,550 --> 00:01:36,727
Phir AI chain.

35
00:01:36,727 --> 00:01:40,509
Ollama pehle, bilkul tumhare apne machine pe.

36
00:01:40,509 --> 00:01:44,291
Phir GLM, NVIDIA NIM, OpenRouter, aur Gemini.

37
00:01:44,291 --> 00:01:47,990
Ek provider fail hua to agla jawab deta hai.

38
00:01:47,990 --> 00:01:51,016
Aur sab fail ho gaye to bhi database

39
00:01:51,016 --> 00:01:52,613
ka jawab milta hai.

40
00:01:52,613 --> 00:01:54,630
System kabhi rukta nahi.

41
00:01:56,050 --> 00:02:00,230
Libraries aur models, bilkul jo ship hua hai.

42
00:02:00,230 --> 00:02:02,088
Node 20 aur Express.

43
00:02:02,088 --> 00:02:05,153
Prisma 7, libSQL driver ke saath.

44
00:02:05,153 --> 00:02:09,333
SQLite, FTS5 index aur BM25 ranking ke saath.

45
00:02:09,333 --> 00:02:12,306
Text aur layout ke liye PyMuPDF.

46
00:02:12,306 --> 00:02:14,814
Rapid OCR, ONNX Runtime pe.

47
00:02:14,814 --> 00:02:18,437
Ollama chalata hai Qwen 2.5 7B locally.

48
00:02:18,437 --> 00:02:19,552
Cloud chain:

49
00:02:19,552 --> 00:02:24,846
GLM 4.7 Flash, NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Lightning, OpenRouter,

50
00:02:24,846 --> 00:02:26,890
aur Gemini Flash Lite.

51
00:02:28,550 --> 00:02:30,781
Aur ye film bhi aise hi bani.

52
00:02:30,781 --> 00:02:34,398
Brag ne di storyboard, music aur sound effects.

53
00:02:34,398 --> 00:02:38,014
Cinematic Skill ne chalayi camera aur captions.

54
00:02:38,014 --> 00:02:40,861
Voice Studio ne suara aur mix banaya.

55
00:02:40,861 --> 00:02:44,785
OmniVoice ne guide kiya multilingual speech design.

56
00:02:44,785 --> 00:02:48,556
Aur Playwright MCP ne liye saare real screenshots

57
00:02:48,556 --> 00:02:49,710
jo aapne dekhe.

58
00:02:51,550 --> 00:02:53,761
Tumhara data tumhara rehta hai.

59
00:02:53,761 --> 00:02:56,615
Koi bhi page dekho, export karo TXT, CSV

60
00:02:56,615 --> 00:03:00,039
ya JSON mein, delete karo confirmation ke saath.

61
00:03:00,039 --> 00:03:02,179
Poora app chalta hai phone pe.

62
00:03:02,179 --> 00:03:05,532
Aur repository mein milti hai poori Docker plus

63
00:03:05,532 --> 00:03:07,030
EC2 deployment guide.

64
00:03:08,550 --> 00:03:10,327
Setup ek command hai.

65
00:03:10,327 --> 00:03:11,936
Run ek command hai.

66
00:03:11,936 --> 00:03:14,136
Phir PDF daalo aur poocho.

67
00:03:14,136 --> 00:03:18,537
Poori guide, Word documents aur code, sab repository

68
00:03:18,537 --> 00:03:19,299
mein hai.

69
00:03:19,299 --> 00:03:20,230
Dhanyavaad!

